cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Scaffali: rack location management for a finished-goods warehouse (2002–2003)"
version: "1.3.4"
abstract: "Scaffali manages where finished reels and pallets are stored in a racked warehouse. When a product is put away the operator assigns rack, row and column; the program then supports picking and moving stock between locations. Product and packing data are read from the packing database of the plant."
authors:
